      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should-fix: this is quadratic, because Vali\u0027s `string-ref` walks the string to the index (`chars().nth(i)`). For n non-ASCII characters, n \u003d 10k / 20k / 40k take 2.6 / 8.8 / 35 s, against 0.04 / 0.04 / 0.09 s for `string-for-each`; ASCII strings are quadratic too. Either iterate over `(string-\u003elist str start end)`, documenting that later changes to the string aren\u0027t seen, or keep this until `string-ref` gets the index hints of ADR 0002 #11, with a comment saying so.",
      "revId": "da9acb64fe00b9596e9b9921bb926aaff1a00467",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
