      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should-fix: each value costs O(k) for k generators, since every call rebuilds two k-long lists and scans every head. On the debug CLI, merging k generators of 10 values takes 11 s at k\u003d250, 42 s at k\u003d500 and 170 s at k\u003d1000, against under 0.1 s for `gappend`. Pair the generators into a balanced tree of lazy two-way merges: O(log k) per value, and leftmost-wins on ties still holds if left stays left.",
      "revId": "da9acb64fe00b9596e9b9921bb926aaff1a00467",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
