      "message": "Fixed. Merging k \u003d 250 / 500 / 1000 / 2000 / 4000 generators of 10 values takes 0.10 / 0.25 / 0.70 / 1.2 / 2.6 s (it was 11 / 42 / 170 s for the first three). 2000 random merges of up to 9 generators match a stable sort, so the leftmost wins on ties, and making the merge reads nothing.",
